<style>
.ps-page { min-height: calc(100vh - 120px); background: #f8f7f4; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 16px; }
.ps-card { width: 100%; max-width: 480px; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(26,31,46,0.10); overflow: hidden; }
.ps-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a, #22c55e); padding: 36px 28px; text-align: center; color: #fff; }
.ps-icon-wrap { width: 72px; height: 72px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 16px; font-size: 32px; animation: ps-pop 0.5s ease; }
@keyframes ps-pop { from { transform: scale(0.5); opacity: 0; } to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }
.ps-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.ps-sub { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.92; }
.ps-body { padding: 28px; }
.ps-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; background: #f8f7f4; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.ps-poster { width: 64px; height: 42px; border-radius: 6px; object-fit: cover; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.ps-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1f2e; }
.ps-meta { font-size: 12px; color: #718096; margin-top: 2px; }
.ps-info { background: #eff4ff; border: 1px solid rgba(59,111,212,0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
.ps-info i { color: #3b6fd4; margin-top: 2px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.ps-info div { font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; }
.ps-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
.ps-btn { flex: 1; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s; }
.ps-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1f2e, #3b6fd4); color: #fff; }
.ps-btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; color: #fff; }
.ps-btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: #3b6fd4; border: 1.5px solid #3b6fd4; }
.ps-btn-ghost:hover { background: #eff4ff; }
</style>

<div class="ps-page">
  <div class="ps-card">
    <div class="ps-header">
      <div class="ps-icon-wrap">✓</div>
      <div class="ps-title">Đăng ký buổi thực hành thành công!</div>
      <div class="ps-sub">Đã thanh toán <%= amount.toLocaleString('vi-VN') %>₫</div>
    </div>

    <div class="ps-body">
      <div class="ps-row">
        <img class="ps-poster" src="<%= cls.poster || 'https://i.ibb.co/wr2CLVVd/default-poster.png' %>" />
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
          <div class="ps-name"><%= session.title || cls.name %></div>
          <div class="ps-meta">
            <%= cls.name %>
            <% if (session.date) { %> · <%= new Date(session.date).toLocaleString('vi-VN', {day:'2-digit',month:'2-digit',year:'numeric',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}) %><% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ps-info">
        <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
        <div>
          Bạn có thể truy cập link buổi học trong mục <strong>Buổi thực hành của tôi</strong>. Link tham gia sẽ hiển thị khi gần đến giờ học.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ps-actions">
        <a href="/practice" class="ps-btn ps-btn-ghost">
          <i class="fas fa-list"></i> Các lớp khác
        </a>
        <a href="/practice/my" class="ps-btn ps-btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Buổi của tôi
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
